  "instructions": [
    "Cook the rice according to package instructions.",
    "Dry fry the khao khua in a pan until lightly toasted.",
    "Grind the toasted khao khua into a fine powder.",
    "Soak the dried Chinese apricots in hot water until they are rehydrated.",
    "Mix the cooked rice, ground khao khua, soy sauce, sesame oil, salt, and sugar in a large bowl.",
    "Add the rehydrated apricots to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a pan and stir fry the mixture for 2 minutes.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving dish and garnish with chopped scallions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
